Single-page responsive website for selling Rudraksha in Prayagraj.\
\
## How to use\
\
1. Open `index.html` in any browser (Chrome, Safari, etc.)\
2. Add your real product images to the `images/` folder\
3. Update product list in `script.js` \uc0\u8594  `const products = [...]`\
4. For production:\
   - Host on GitHub Pages, Vercel, Netlify, etc.\
   - Add real backend (Node.js + Nodemailer or Firebase) for orders\
\
## To upload to GitHub\
\
1. Open Terminal\
2. cd to this folder\
3. Run these commands:\
\
```bash\
git init\
git add .\
git commit -m "Initial website version"\
git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/YOUR_REPO_NAME.git\
git branch -M main\
git push -u origin main}